                "description": "Schalge F Series Accent Door Lever - The quiet beauty of the Accent Lever with the Brookshire Rose is reminiscent of the old world. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses. Available in 5 finishes in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions.",
